WEBVTT

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:04.570
I'm sorry I wasn't able to help you then.

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:06.660
You're apologizing to me as well?

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:10.750
You have nothing to apologize for.

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:13.960
Even if I should lose my life,

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.630
I must know His Majesty's intentions.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:17.800
Please.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.920
I don't care what you're hiding.

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.340
Just make sure you think hard before you act.

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:26.890
You love Charioce, don't you?

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:42.530
How is Lady Gabriel?

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:44.780
She hasn't responded to any of us.

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:46.620
She's locked herself in her chamber.

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:48.950
First El, then Jeanne.

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:52.040
And now even Lady Sofiel has left.

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:11.930
Sofiel...

00:01:16.150 --> 00:01:17.650
My goodness.

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:19.440
You can't blame them.

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:22.570
Terrorism has been rampant lately.

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:26.700
And the fugitives could still be hiding here.

00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:31.620
There was that scary red dragon
flying around last night too.

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:34.660
When are things going to finally
settle down?

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:38.330
Apparently there's gonna be a ball
at the palace tonight.

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:42.460
Must be nice that the aristocrats
can still enjoy themselves.

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:55.940
Lady Sofiel.

00:01:57.520 --> 00:02:00.150
I still have not found him.

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:06.780
The many soldiers on patrol are making
this difficult.

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:10.160
What information is there on Nina or Bacchus?

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:11.490
Nothing.

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:17.500
The only information I managed to hear were just rumors
of a dragon flying over Anatae last night.

00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:19.170
What color was the dragon?

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:20.380
Color?

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:23.380
I think they said it was red.

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:24.670
Nina...

00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:26.510
What do you mean?

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:30.850
Nina is dragonfolk, and she's
able to transform into a dragon.

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:34.100
Please! Let me go as well!

00:02:34.270 --> 00:02:36.100
El is probably with Nina and the others.

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:37.270
No.

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:48.280
There will be fewer soldiers once
the sun goes down.

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:50.820
As long as you promise not
to leave my side...

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:10.640
Rage of Bahamut

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:13.850
They are the same
and lose themselves

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:22.020
Cuz there are lots of roads to go
And the path suddenly seems rougher

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:27.570
I wanna walk straight ahead
Knock down another dream

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:32.950
Most broke before they ever came true

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:37.200
But walk this way

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:42.630
Get out of my way

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:50.300
Depends on the way you think it
To a yielding heart

00:03:50.470 --> 00:03:54.970
the future, hope,
despair and worry all look all the same

00:03:56.680 --> 00:04:01.270
So much that you'll turn down the truth
that lied to you that day

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:05.980
when you were prepared for it all.
You go your way, don't you?

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:10.440
But walk this way

00:04:12.070 --> 00:04:15.530
Get out of my way

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:21.160
But walk this way

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:24.140
Listen up.

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:29.150
First, Nina and the aristocrat boy
will infiltrate the palace.

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:33.150
Once you locate the king inside the palace,
you will stand by and wait.

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:38.820
Afro and the big guy there will infiltrate the palace
from the knights' barracks.

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:41.040
Why me?

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:43.080
Because Kaisar was the captain,

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:46.210
Azazel is a demon, and the drunk is a god.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:48.670
That just leaves you.

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:50.000
She has a point!

00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:54.340
So, once we confirm Afro is in,

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:56.340
I will give the signal.

00:05:56.510 --> 00:05:58.720
Then you transform into a dragon.

00:05:58.930 --> 00:05:59.890
Do I get to smash things?

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:01.720
No.

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:03.890
We just need them confused.

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:08.190
You will steal the king's bracelet in the confusion,

00:06:08.350 --> 00:06:11.520
and then climb on Nina's back
to escape from the terrace.

00:06:11.690 --> 00:06:13.650
Will it really go that well?

00:06:13.820 --> 00:06:16.200
Nina will be fine as long as she transforms.

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:17.450
What about me?

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:18.950
Don't worry.

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:22.030
If you get caught, we'll break you
out of prison again.

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:26.620
For the rest of you, on the off chance
the escape plan fails,

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:28.500
you're to secure the escape routes

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:30.840
and engage any pursuers.

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:33.840
I will go to the palace as well.

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:39.470
You will be standing by near the escape route

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:41.640
in case the Onyx Soldiers appear.

00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:43.680
Azazel, you watch after him.

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:44.970
But—

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:55.740
To be honest, this plan isn't the best.

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:57.780
I don't know what might happen.

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:00.030
So nobody be reckless.

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:07.620
This plan hinges on me.

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:08.790
What?

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:15.250
What in the world is she doing?

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:17.300
In any case, the young lady

00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:21.430
seemed very eager to be the one to
infiltrate the palace.

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:25.680
She probably wants to eat the palace food.

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:31.600
I hope that's all it is.

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:33.860
How are the others doing?

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:41.530
Good work, men.

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:45.240
-You look right at home.
-I suppose I do.

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:50.080
I may not look it, but I used to be a knight.

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:52.120
Was that ten years ago?

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:56.380
Yeah, along with that captain of yours.

00:07:59.550 --> 00:08:01.970
-This appears to be it.
-Yeah.

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:09.890
All right, I'm off then.

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:11.890
Okay, good luck.

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:13.560
Oh, I almost forgot.

00:08:13.730 --> 00:08:16.320
I'm counting on you guys to secure
our escape route.

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:17.360
Of course.

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:20.650
She probably won't be able to transform.

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:22.820
What do you mean by that?

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:31.290
We, the Onyx Soldiers,

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:35.290
offer our lives to serve Your Majesty.

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:38.630
Please give us the order.

00:08:48.350 --> 00:08:49.470
Enter.

00:08:52.730 --> 00:08:54.060
Your Majesty.

00:08:54.230 --> 00:08:57.270
It is almost time for the ball.

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:02.150
I understand your feelings,

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:05.070
but with the uncertainty of the coming war,

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:09.240
fund-raising events are an important
part of a king's duties.

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:26.890
This is amazing!

00:09:27.140 --> 00:09:28.550
All right!

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:30.560
Hey!

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:39.230
Idiot, cut that out!
People will get suspicious!

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:43.240
Why? I'm just eating here!

00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:46.320
Just stop it!

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:48.570
Oh, my!

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:52.660
If it isn't the young Visponti lad!

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:56.120
I believe it has been a while since we last
saw you at an event like this.

00:09:56.290 --> 00:09:59.880
Oh, well, hello.

00:10:01.170 --> 00:10:02.630
Who might this young lady be?

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:05.630
She's...

00:10:05.800 --> 00:10:07.510
I'm his fiance!

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:11.970
Oh, I see...

00:10:12.140 --> 00:10:14.020
She's a lovely girl.

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:18.150
Thank you so much!

00:10:19.020 --> 00:10:20.730
What's wrong?

00:10:52.260 --> 00:10:54.220
Hey, Alland.

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:56.730
Is that supposed to be me?

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:59.520
What are those girls doing?

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:02.730
They're waiting for the king's invitation.

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:05.860
Invitation for what?

00:11:06.030 --> 00:11:07.780
To dance.

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:17.620
Hey, whoa! Hold up, hold up!

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:06.670
Is King Charioce going to dance?

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:08.300
That would be a first.

00:12:08.510 --> 00:12:11.930
Actually, didn't it seem like the girl
was the one to invite him to dance?

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:16.760
What is she doing?

00:12:16.930 --> 00:12:21.770
Young man! Your fiance just asked
the king to dance!

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:25.150
-Oh, that's actually my younger sister.
-What?

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:29.000
Now how in the world did she end up
dancing with the king?

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:08.500
Rage of Bahamut

00:14:24.020 --> 00:14:26.600
I'd never seen that kind of dance before.

00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:32.900
The last time we danced together
was fun,

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:35.110
but this was really nice too.

00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:40.780
Oh, that's right. There was something
I was supposed to ask him.

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:43.410
We need to talk.

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:44.750
Here it comes!

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:54.920
What's wrong? Does your stomach hurt?

00:14:57.300 --> 00:14:59.930
Are you mad?

00:15:00.090 --> 00:15:04.060
Did I do something?

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:08.890
We cannot see each other again.

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:14.480
I cannot see you again.

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:15.940
Not ever.

00:15:19.910 --> 00:15:21.450
What are you talking about?

00:15:21.990 --> 00:15:26.120
I've dedicated my life to
fulfilling my duties.

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:29.580
So, weren't you going to tell me about that today?

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:32.920
It is none of your concern.

00:15:40.340 --> 00:15:41.890
What's wrong?

00:15:42.050 --> 00:15:44.390
You just danced with me!

00:15:44.760 --> 00:15:47.470
And you kissed me that time before!

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:56.780
Were you lying when you said that you
were going to tell me everything?

00:15:56.980 --> 00:15:59.570
Yes, it was a lie.

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:00.860
What else would it be?

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:03.620
Now leave.

00:16:03.820 --> 00:16:06.580
If you don't, I will call the
guards to seize you.

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:25.140
Wow, talk about a terrible man.

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:28.930
She's still my student.

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:31.480
I'd appreciate it if you didn't hurt her.

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:33.940
Master...

00:16:34.810 --> 00:16:37.190
Why don't you hand over that bracelet of yours?

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:48.160
Once worn, it can't be taken off
as long as I live.

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:52.040
Then, sorry, you're either gonna have to
get your arm chopped off or die.

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:53.790
Mr. King.

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:01.170
No!

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:02.510
Hey!

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:04.050
You can't shoot him!

00:17:09.010 --> 00:17:10.770
But Nina,

00:17:10.930 --> 00:17:14.140
that king might go on to kill a lot of people.

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:15.850
But you still can't!

00:17:21.780 --> 00:17:25.450
Then how about I shoot you and
kill Charioce?

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:51.520
This charade ends here.
The guards shall arrive soon.

00:17:51.850 --> 00:17:53.560
You're right.

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:56.480
I think it's time for us to leave.

00:17:56.650 --> 00:17:58.190
Hey!

00:17:58.360 --> 00:18:00.270
Can we never dance together again?

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:04.950
No, never again.

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:25.550
I told you not to hurt her!

00:18:25.970 --> 00:18:27.970
-Mr. King...
-Don't move!

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:29.720
Your Highness, are you okay?

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:33.390
Ah, shoot.

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:36.100
Looks like we took too long.

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:37.560
Stand up.

00:18:37.770 --> 00:18:39.060
Wait.

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:40.360
Your Majesty!

00:18:45.900 --> 00:18:48.240
The plan failed! Signal everyone!

00:18:49.200 --> 00:18:51.070
You got it!

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:02.790
Lady Sofiel.

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:10.840
Young man! Your sister seems to be in trouble!

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:14.010
Huh? Oh! I'm going to go help her.

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:16.020
Find them!

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:18.060
They couldn't have gotten far!

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:26.030
Secure the back!

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:29.820
The bandits are still in the palace!

00:19:29.990 --> 00:19:31.740
-Don't let them get away!
-Yes sir!

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:35.950
-That was a beautiful performance.
-Hurry.

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:38.790
Nina, you can be depressed later.

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:41.120
We have to run now.

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:46.630
Master, I just got dumped.

00:19:49.760 --> 00:19:53.760
You're right. We need to focus on getting away now.

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:05.610
This way!

00:20:09.610 --> 00:20:12.240
Hey, hold on!
You're too fast!

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:13.700
What happened?!

00:20:26.090 --> 00:20:29.630
I'm never getting involved with them ever again.

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:33.220
-I'm going home.
-Where are you going?

00:20:38.640 --> 00:20:40.680
I got lost.

00:20:41.350 --> 00:20:43.810
The slums are this way.

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:03.670
Jeanne D'Arc.

00:21:07.170 --> 00:21:08.880
Mother.

00:21:23.480 --> 00:21:31.320
As horrible as you are
I can't help but love you

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:39.160
Even while I waited
That is all I felt

00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:47.330
Ephemeral lovers, both flawed and missing pieces
We have finally become one

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:54.720
in this miniature garden at the edge of sorrow
Can you hear my heart speaking?

00:21:55.220 --> 00:22:02.770
Ah, I may no longer feel
that I want to go back in time

00:22:03.270 --> 00:22:10.320
But there are feelings, feelings, feelings
I can only feel now

00:22:10.480 --> 00:22:18.410
I want to run away with you, dancing
just like in a fairy tale

00:22:18.660 --> 00:22:26.370
Don't tell me it will only be this once, darling
I am on the same ark

00:22:27.420 --> 00:22:30.790
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Yeah

00:22:31.290 --> 00:22:35.340
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Cinderella step

00:22:35.510 --> 00:22:38.760
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Yeah

00:22:38.970 --> 00:22:42.890
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Cinderella step

00:22:43.060 --> 00:22:43.890
Yeah

00:22:48.230 --> 00:22:49.560
Hold on, Nina!

00:22:52.230 --> 00:22:53.320
I told you to stop!

00:23:17.170 --> 00:23:20.640
We have seen enough of your tricks.

00:23:21.510 --> 00:23:22.220
Master!

00:23:22.390 --> 00:23:24.970
Stay back! Run, Nina!

00:23:34.610 --> 00:23:36.940
So you are the red dragon?

00:23:39.110 --> 00:23:41.200
You will die here.

00:23:47.200 --> 00:23:49.660
Charioce XVII's morning starts early.

00:23:50.120 --> 00:23:52.040
What could he be pondering about?

00:23:52.290 --> 00:23:56.800
Next time on Rage of Bahamut:
Virgin Soul, "From Heaven to Hell."

00:23:57.090 --> 00:23:59.670
- First, we must eat some meat.
- You must really like it, huh?

00:23:59.880 --> 00:24:01.220
Would you like some?

00:24:01.380 --> 00:24:02.090
BAHA SOUL!!

00:24:02.260 --> 00:24:03.600
Baha Baha Baha Soul!

00:24:03.850 --> 00:24:05.560
Watch next time too!
